QuestGuidance.Register("en",376,{
[12001]="7000E8BB\n1\tTalk to Halbarad\tHalbarad is at Esteldín in the North Downs. Handarod has asked you to speak with Halbarad and lend him your aid in defending Trestlebridge. The townsfolk will not be able to defend against the Orcs alone. Handarod suggested that you take allies with you.\n2\tTalk to Nellie Boskins\tNellie Boskins can be found in Trestlebridge. At Halbarad's side, you helped defend Trestlebridge from the Orcs that sought to destroy it. At the conclusion of the battle, Nellie Boskins asked to speak with you.\n",
[12002]="70018182\n1\tDefeat Nightshine\tThe Dark Delvings lie in the south-eastern reaches of the Foundations of Stone. Ingthor has instructed you to help a fellow Guardian complete his or her final task at the Dark Delvings.\n2\tReturn to Ingthor\tIngthor is just outside the Dark Delvings. With Nightshine slain, you should return to Ingthor with news of your success.\n",
[12003]="7002C913\n1\tDefeat Dushatár the Defiler\tDushatár dwells in the depths of the Mor-hai cave to the north-west. Frithstan has asked you to gather allies in order to put an end to Dushatár and his schemes of brewing deadly poisons.\n2\tReturn to Frithstan at his camp\tFrithstan is waiting at his camp along the road west of Stangard. Frithstan awaits news of your attack against the Defiler, Dushatár.\n",
[12004]="7003E2AB\n1\tFind and defeat the Tarkrîp defiler\tThe Tarkrîp defiler is in Nan Wathren in the southern North Downs. You should defeat the Tarkrîp defiler, for his potions have been used to disastrous effect in Trestlebridge. Fellowship Recommended.\n2\tFind and defeat the Tarkrîp defiler\tThe Tarkrîp defiler is in Nan Wathren in the southern North Downs. You should defeat the Tarkrîp defiler, for his potions have been used to disastrous effect in Trestlebridge.\n3\tDestroy the brewing station\tThe defiler's brewing station can be found in Nan Wathren, deep at the bottom of a flooded gorge. You should destroy the defiler's brewing station.\n4\tCompleted\tYou have defeated the defiler responsible for brewing the sleeping draught that led to the catastrophe at Trestlebridge.\n",
[12005]="7005976E\n1\tDestroy supply crates at the East-delf and West-delf\tSupply crates can be found at the East-delf and the West-delf in the Wildwood. You should destroy supply crates at the East-delf and the West-delf.\n2\tDestroy supply crates at the East-delf and West-delf (total: 10)\tSupply crates can be found at the East-delf and the West-delf in the Wildwood. You should destroy supply crates at the East-delf and the West-delf.\n",
[12006]="7005977C\n1\tDefeat foes at the East-delf and West-delf\tFoes can be found at the East-delf and West-delf in the Wildwood. You should defeat foes at the East-delf and West-delf.\n2\tDefeat foes at the East-delf and West-delf (total: 12)\tFoes can be found at the East-delf and West-delf in the Wildwood. You should defeat foes at the East-delf and West-delf.\n",
[12007]="700255F4\n1\tMount a race-horse\030Mount a race-pony\tThe festival steeds can be found spoiling for the race near the stable at the Delving Fields Festival race-track. You should mount a steed to begin the race -- a pony if you are shorter in stature, or a horse if you are of a taller build.\n2\tCross the starting line\tThe gates can be found by following the race-track at the Delving Fields race-track. You must race through all the gates before the timer runs out. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n3\tRace to the first gate\tThe gates can be found by following the race-track at the Delving Fields race-track. You must race through all the gates before the timer runs out. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n4\tRace through the low second gate through sticky mud\030Race through the high second gate over the precarious jump\tThe gates can be found by following the race-track at the Delving Fields race-track. You must race through all the gates before the timer runs out. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n5\tRace to the third gate\tThe gates can be found by following the race-track at the Delving Fields race-track. You must race through all the gates before the timer runs out. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n6\tRace to the fourth gate\tThe gates can be found by following the race-track at the Delving Fields race-track. You must race through all the gates before the timer runs out. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n7\tRace to the fifth gate\tThe gates can be found by following the race-track at the Delving Fields race-track. You must race through all the gates before the timer runs out. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n8\tRace to the sixth gate\tThe gates can be found by following the race-track at the Delving Fields race-track. You must race through all the gates before the timer runs out. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n9\tRace to the seventh gate\tThe gates can be found by following the race-track at the Delving Fields race-track. You must race through all the gates before the timer runs out. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n10\tRace to the eighth gate\tThe gates can be found by following the race-track at the Delving Fields race-track. You must race through all the gates before the timer runs out. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n11\tRace through the low ninth gate through sticky mud\030Race through the high ninth gate over the precarious jump\tThe gates can be found by following the race-track at the Delving Fields race-track. You must race through all the gates before the timer runs out. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n12\tRace to the tenth gate\tThe gates can be found by following the race-track at the Delving Fields race-track. You must race through all the gates before the timer runs out. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n13\tRace to the eleventh gate\tThe gates can be found by following the race-track at the Delving Fields race-track. You must race through all the gates before the timer runs out. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n14\tCross the finish line before the time runs out\tThe finish line is near! You must race through all the gates before the timer runs out. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n15\tSpeak with Carl Proudfoot\tCarl Proudfoot stands next to the finish line at the race-track in the Delving Fields. You should speak with Carl Proudfoot and inform him of your success.\n",
