[12014]="700529D2\n1\tDefeat Wargs in Duskenvale\t\n2\tDefeat wargs in Duskenvale (total: 15)\tDuskenvale has become a haven of the foul Wargs of the Vales. You should defeat wargs in Duskenvale and Shathur-munzu.\n3\tCompleted\tCompleted.\n",
[12015]="7000E372\n1\tDefeat the den-mother\tThe den-mother may be found on an island near the lake's western shore. Urho has asked you to seek out the den-mother of the wolf-pack and defeat her.\n2\tTalk to Santtu\tSanttu is at Kauppa-kohta, on the eastern shore of the lake. Now that you have defeated the wolves' den-mother, you should return to Santtu with news of your victory.\n",
[12016]="7004E6C3\n1\tEnter the Glimmerdeep\tYou should enter the Glimmerdeep, which lies on Mount Thrumfall north of Skarháld.\n2\tTalk to Hórin\tYou should talk to Hórin.\n3\tDefeat foes in the Glimmerdeep (total: 4)\030Survey the Glimmerdeep\tYou should survey the Glimmerdeep and defeat foes you find there.\n4\tDefeat more foes in the Glimmerdeep (total: 4)\030Survey another part of the Glimmerdeep\tYou should continue surveying the Glimmerdeep and defeating foes you find.\n5\tDefeat even more foes in the Glimmerdeep (total: 4)\030Continue to survey the Glimmerdeep\tYou should continue surveying the Glimmerdeep and defeating foes you find.\n6\tTalk to Hórin\tYou should talk to Hórin.\n",
[12017]="70053550\n1\tTalk to Elrond\tGandalf has asked you to speak to Elrond. He can be found outside the Beorninghús.\n2\tFind Elrond and Glorfindel at Kidzul-kâlah\tElrond and Glorfindel have travelled to Kidzul-kâlah to seek answers from the Maiden of the Gladden. You should find them somewhere near the entrance to Kidzul-kâlah.\n3\tTalk to Glorfindel\tGlorfindel would like to speak with you. He can be found outside Kidzul-kâlah.\n4\tTalk to Gultháva\tGlorfindel has asked that you try to question Gultháva, the Maiden of the Gladden, about the fate of Kidzul-kâlah. You should talk to Gultháva.\n5\tTalk to Elrond\tElrond would like to speak with you. He is standing by outside Kidzul-kâlah.\n6\tTalk to Gultháva\tThe Maiden of the Gladden waits to hear if you will help her cleanse Kidzul-kâlah. You should talk to Gultháva.\n7\tComplete The Depths of Kidzul-kâlah\tComplete The Depths of Kidzul-kâlah on any difficulty mode. You may enter this instance by using the Instance Join panel.\n8\tTalk to Gultháva\tGultháva can be found either outside Kidzul-kâlah or inside after defeating the Grasping Maw. You should talk to Gultháva.\n",
[12018]="7005354F\n1\tTalk to Elrond\tElrond and Glorfindel are standing by. You should talk to Elrond.\n2\tPass the Test of the Maiden\tThe Maid wishes to test your strength before allowing you passage into the mines of Kidzul-kâlah. If Elrond or Glorfindel will not answer the call of the Beacon of Imladris, try using the chat command /pet release twice to dismiss them, and then re-summon them with the Beacon.\n3\tDefeat the Grasping Maw\tNow that you have passed the Maid's test, it is time to confront the darkness within the mines. If Elrond or Glorfindel will not answer the call of the Beacon of Imladris, try using the chat command /pet release twice to dismiss them, and then re-summon them with the Beacon.\n4\tTalk to Elrond\tElrond would like to speak with you. If he is no longer with you, you may call him to your side with the Beacon of Imladris. If Elrond or Glorfindel will not answer the call of the Beacon of Imladris, try using the chat command /pet release twice to dismiss them, and then re-summon them with the Beacon.\n",
[12019]="7005354E\n1\tPass the Test of the Maiden\tThe Maid wishes to test your strength before allowing you passage into the mines of Kidzul-kâlah.\n2\tDefeat the Grasping Maw\tNow that you have passed the Maid's test, it is time to confront the darkness within the mines.\n",
