[12022]="70069839\n1\tDefeat Azagath's Sea-shade and his crew\030Defeat Belondor and his crew\030Defeat Umshûra the Glutton within the Mâkhda Khorbo\tAfter escaping the Citadel of winds, Azagath Sea-shadow, Belondor, and Nakási Wave-reaper entered the Mâkhda Khorbo. You pursued them into the temple of ash and blood and now scour the depths for the trio.\n",
[12023]="7006A150\n1\tDefeat Azagath's Sea-shade and his crew\030Defeat Belondor and his crew\030Defeat Umshûra the Glutton within the Mâkhda Khorbo\tAfter escaping the Citadel of winds, Azagath Sea-shadow, Belondor, and Nakási Wave-reaper entered the Mâkhda Khorbo. You pursued them into the temple of ash and blood and now scour the depths for the trio.\n",
[12024]="7006A14F\n1\tDefeat Azagath's Sea-shade and his crew\030Defeat Belondor and his crew\030Defeat Umshûra the Glutton within the Mâkhda Khorbo\tAzagath's personal guard, bolstered by a fell-shade of the man, bar the entrance to the smuggler's cover beneath Mâkhda Khorbo. Their orders are to slaughter any interlopers.\n",
[12025]="7006A14E\n1\tDefeat Azagath's Sea-shade and his crew\030Defeat Belondor and his crew\030Defeat Umshûra the Glutton within the Mâkhda Khorbo\tAzagath's personal guard, bolstered by a fell-shade of the man, bar the entrance to the smuggler's cover beneath Mâkhda Khorbo. Their orders are to slaughter any interlopers.\n",
[12026]="7006A14D\n1\tDefeat Azagath's Sea-shade and his crew\030Defeat Belondor and his crew\030Defeat Umshûra the Glutton within the Mâkhda Khorbo\tAzagath's personal guard, bolstered by a fell-shade of the man, bar the entrance to the smuggler's cover beneath Mâkhda Khorbo. Their orders are to slaughter any interlopers.\n",
[12027]="70021E81\n1\tCollect wild berries in the Mournshaws (total: 12)\tBerries may be found along the forest paths in the Mournshaws. Umfrë suggests that you gather berries as a tithe to the Derudh of the Mournshaws before you approach them.\n2\tBring the berries to the Derudh at Galar Culch\tThe Derudh of the Mournshaws may be found at a stone circle called Galar Culch to the south of Echad Daervunn. Umfrë told you to approach the Derudh with an offering of berries.\n3\tTalk to Enit at Galar Culch\tEnit is at Galar Culch, south of Echad Daervunn. Enit the Derudh may know a way through the Mournshaws into Dunland.\n",
[12028]="70027F4D\n1\tDefeat the Devourer\tThe Devourer dwells somewhere in the Orc-mines. Meriun asked you to find and defeat the Devourer, an enormous pit-worm that hunts unwary slaves within the mine.\n2\tTalk to Meriun in the Orc-mines\tMeriun is in the Orc-mines. You should return and tell Meriun that you have slain the Devourer.\n",
[12029]="70048C69\n1\tCollect medical supplies (total: 3)\tThe stolen medical supplies are hidden in Viznak's hideout. You should find and collect the medical supplies.\n2\tAttempt to heal Rhadrog with Maiden's Helm\tRhadrog is becoming increasingly ill in Viznak's hideout. You should try and heal Rhadrog using the medical supplies.\n3\tAttempt to heal Rhadrog with Wanderbeard\tRhadrog is becoming increasingly ill in Viznak's Hideout. You should try and heal Rhadrog using the medical supplies.\n4\tAttempt to heal Rhadrog with Kingsfoil\tRhadrog is becoming increasingly ill in Viznak's hideout. You should try and heal Rhadrog using the medical supplies.\n5\tTalk to Faeron\tFaeron can be found at Viznak's hideout. You should talk to Faeron.\n",
[12030]="7006BF75\n1\tGather discarded cloth in Urmâkh for stray dogs (total: 8)\030Gather loose rope in Urmâkh for stray dogs (total: 6)\tBarûl has asked for your help in collecting discarded cloth to treat wounds and loose rope for leashes for the stray dogs of Urmâkh. You can find discarded cloth and loose rope around Urmâkh.\n2\tReturn to Barûl in Urmâkh with the items you've found\tReturn to Barûl in Urmâkh with the cloth and rope you have collected.\n",
[12031]="7006BF6D\n1\tSpeak with Agiti about the vanished dogs\030Speak with Sûdakh about the vanished dogs\030Speak with Ghemûna about the vanished dogs\tSpeak with Urmâkh villagers to learn more about the vanishing of Urmâkh's dogs.\n2\tCheck the southern edge of Urmâkh for signs of dogs\030Check the north-eastern corner of Urmâkh for signs of dogs\030Check near the blacksmith's forge for signs of dogs\tCheck the rumoured dog locations to see if any clues or dogs reside there.\n3\tReturn to speak with Urdush\tReturn to speak with Urdush.\n",
[12032]="7006BF6C\n1\tSpeak with Niriga in Urmâkh\tSpeak with Niriga in Urmâkh to determine the best course of action.\n2\tSpeak with Sûdakh in Urmâkh\030Speak with Ghemûna in Urmâkh\tSpeak with Sûdakh and Ghemûna in Urmâkh.\n3\tSpeak with Niriga when you are ready to go\tReturn to Niriga in Urmâkh with what you have learned.\n4\tReturn to Niriga in Urmâkh\tReturn to Niriga in Urmâkh and tell her what happened in Shakhdag.\n",
})
